# gui-toolbox UI

When building or changing UI in `gui-toolbox`:

1. **Always check shadcn first** — look under `src/shared/ui/` or add with `bunx --bun shadcn@latest add <component>` before inventing custom UI.
2. Prefer composing shadcn primitives (`Button`, `Badge`, `Dialog`, `Input`, etc.) over one-off markup.
3. Keep Cursor Dark theme tokens already defined in `src/index.css`; do not introduce a separate design system.
4. Use Lucide icons (shadcn default) for actions.
5. Follow domain-driven folders in `gui-toolbox-domains` rule.
